    "enUS": {
      "description": "Now that the immediate threat of the murloc attacks is under control, I'd encourage you to show yourself around our stronghold. It isn't much yet, but it's home.\r\n\r\nWhen you are done exploring, seek out Danitha Morr, our leader. She can help you get settled in.\r\n\r\nI'm very glad to have met you, {name}. May the light be your guide.",
      "objectiveLines": [
